    "detailed_description": "An 3D simulation RPG in which the main character returns to the countryside and enjoys his summer vacation. Let's spend a special summer in the countryside with heroines, by talking, go to various places with countryside, playing, and others, while making memories of the summer.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n~Point~<br />\r\n\u30fbLet's talk a lot with heroines!<br />\r\n\u30fbYou can go to various places in the countryside field.<br />\r\n\u30fbVarious conversation events are available in the field. If you make the right choice, the heroine's likability will increase.<br />\r\n\u30fbTime passes as you walk through the field. Some events are limited to specific time periods.<br />\r\n\u30fbSummer vacation will end in about 30 days. Get to know the heroines and play with them before the end of summer vacation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n~Story~<br />\r\nIn the hot summer sun, I came to the countryside.<br />\r\nMy grandfather picked me up and drove me to the house where I was going to spend my summer vacation.<br />\r\nThere was a girl wearing a white one-piece dress.<br />\r\nBug catching, chasing, summer festivals...<br />\r\nSpecial memories of one summer.",
